---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import EntryCard from '../../components/content/EntryCard.astro';
import {published} from '../../lib/content';
const entries=await published('projects');
---
<BaseLayout title="Projects"><p class="page-kicker">SELECTED WORK / IN PROGRESS</p><h1>Projects</h1><p class="page-intro">직접 만들고 발전시켜 나가는 프로젝트를 정리합니다.</p><div class="card-grid">{entries.map(entry=><EntryCard href={'/projects/'+entry.id+'/'} {...entry.data}/>)}</div>{entries.length===0 && <p class="empty-state">아직 공개된 프로젝트가 없습니다.</p>}</BaseLayout>